EwmhBaseStruts screen $[monitor.primary] 0 0 0 32

DestroyFunc IconManClick
AddToFunc IconManClick
+ I ThisWindow (Raised, Focused, !Iconic, CurrentPage) Iconify
+ I TestRc (Match) Break
+ I ThisWindow Raise
+ I ThisWindow (Iconic) Iconify
+ I ThisWindow (AcceptsFocus) FlipFocus

Style FvwmPanel !Title, !Borders, !Handles, Sticky, \
                WindowListSkip, NeverFocus

Colorset 11 fg black, bg #bebebf, hi white, sh #605f5f

DestroyModuleConfig FvwmPanel: *
*FvwmPanel: Geometry 2560x32+0-0
*FvwmPanel: Colorset 1
*FvwmPanel: Frame 0
*FvwmPanel: Font "xft:SFProText:size=12"
*FvwmPanel: Columns 2560
*FvwmPanel: Rows 1

*FvwmPanel: (64x1, ActiveColorset 2, Icon start.png, \
             Action(Mouse 1) Menu rootmenu Root 0p o100-32p, \
             Action(Mouse 3) Exec exec $[infostore.runcmd])

*FvwmPanel: (2272x1, Padding 4 4, \
             Swallow TaskBarIcons 'Module FvwmIconMan TaskBarIcons')

*FvwmPanel: (160x1, Swallow(NoClose, UseOld) stalonetray 'Exec exec stalonetray -c $HOME/.fvwm/stalonetrayrc')

*FvwmPanel: (64x1, id "FvwmClock", Title "clock")

# taskbar icons
DestroyModuleConfig TaskBarIcons: *
*TaskBarIcons: IconName TaskBarIcons
*TaskBarIcons: Resolution global
*TaskBarIcons: UseWinList true
*TaskBarIcons: FollowFocus true

*TaskBarIcons: Font "xft:SFProText:size=12"
*TaskBarIcons: ButtonGeometry 192x24
*TaskBarIcons: MaxButtonWidth 192
*TaskBarIcons: ManagerGeometry 1x1

*TaskBarIcons: DrawIcons always
*TaskBarIcons: ReliefThickness 3
*TaskBarIcons: Format "%t"

*TaskBarIcons: FocusButton down
*TaskBarIcons: IconButton down
*TaskBarIcons: SelectButton down
*TaskBarIcons: FocusAndSelectButton down
*TaskBarIcons: IconAndSelectButton down

*TaskBarIcons: Background #000000
*TaskBarIcons: PlainColorset 33
*TaskBarIcons: IconColorset 33
*TaskBarIcons: FocusColorset 33
*TaskBarIcons: SelectColorset 33
*TaskBarIcons: IconAndSelectColorset 33
*TaskBarIcons: FocusAndSelectColorset 33

*TaskBarIcons: ShowOnlyIcons false
*TaskBarIcons: Tips never

*TaskBarIcons: Sort weighted
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 10 class=firefox
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 15 class=feishin
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 20 class=discord title=*Discord
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 20 class=vesktop title=Discord*
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 25 class=discord
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 25 class=vesktop
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 30 class=steam title=Steam
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 35 class=steam
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 40 class=org.nicotine_plus.Nicotine
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 45 class=qBittorrent
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 55 class=Alacritty
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 65 class=Thunar
*TaskBarIcons: SortWeight 100 # everything else trailing

*TaskBarIcons: Action Mouse 0 N sendcommand Nop
*TaskBarIcons: Action Mouse 1 A sendcommand IconManClick

# clock loop
PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule FvwmButtons ChangeButton \
FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'

Schedule Periodic 10000 PipeRead 'echo "SendToModule \
FvwmButtons ChangeButton FvwmClock Title \"`date +%I:%M`\""'
